				<r3d:description language="eng">Joint “Space Data Preservation Archive” (formerly indicated as “EO Cold Back-up Archive”) used to receive, ingest and archive EO and other ESA directorates space data for long-term preservation. The archive is interfaced with EO and Science missions PDGSs through Front End Circulators (PE-FE and Mercury) ensuring internal and external interfaces for data records and associated technical content exchange and circulation.</r3d:description>
